{"t":"Gnomish Crystal Teleport System","s":"gnomish-crystal-teleport-system-8f7ca","k":"outro","i":"assets/wiki/Teleport_Crystal_d76adf.gif","q":7,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p>The Gnomish Crystal Teleport System is a means of <a href=\"#/wiki/Astral%20Bridge\">astral</a> transport from city to city. Players can access this form of transport by talking with <a href=\"#/wiki/Xelvar\">Xelvar</a> in Kazordoon. Use of the teleporter requires a <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Teleport Crystal\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Teleport_Crystal_d76adf.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span><a href=\"#/wiki/Teleport%20Crystal\">Teleport Crystal</a>, which can be bought for 150gp. You also need to be above <a href=\"#/wiki/Level\">Level</a> 80. The hub is located above <a href=\"#/wiki/Gnomegate\">Gnomegate</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Locations_in_Gnomegate\">Locations in <a href=\"#/wiki/Gnomegate\">Gnomegate</a></span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"GCTS Cities\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"290\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/GCTS_Cities_b7a52a.png\" width=\"422\"/></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Locations_in_Cities\">Locations in Cities</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Thais <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32331,32173,9\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32331, 32173, 9)</a> (<a href=\"#/wiki/Ancient%20Temple\">Ancient Temple</a>)</li>\n<li>Darashia <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33186,32384,8\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33186, 32384, 8)</a> (mountain north-west of town)</li>\n<li>Edron <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33154,31835,10\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33154, 31835, 10)</a> (sewer)</li>\n<li>Kazordoon <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32628,31863,11\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32628, 31863, 11)</a> (near the northern <a href=\"#/wiki/Blessings\">blesser</a>)</li>\n<li>Liberty Bay <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32403,32817,6\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32403, 32817, 6)</a> (south-eastern mountains)</li>\n<li>Svargrond <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32196,31183,8\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32196, 31183, 8)</a> (hole by the western exit)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-See_also\">See also</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Astral%20Bridge\">Astral Bridge</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Boat\">Boat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Buddel\">Buddel</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dog%20Sled\">Dog Sled</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Magic%20Carpet\">Magic Carpet</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Nordic%20Tibia%20Ferries\">Nordic Tibia Ferries</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ore%20Wagon\">Ore Wagon</a></li>\n<li>Port Hope Ferries</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Steamship\">Steamship</a></li>\n<li>Traveling</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Turtle\">Turtle</a></li></ul></div>","quests":["bigfoots-burden-quest","crystal-warlord-outfits-quest","dangerous-depths-quest","makeshift-warrior-outfits-quest","opticording-sphere-quest","soil-guardian-outfits-quest","what-a-foolish-quest"]}